<tool id="abricate_list" name="ABRicate List" version="1.4.0+galaxy0" profile="21.05">
  <description>list all the antibiotic databases used by ABRicate</description>
  <macros />
  <xrefs>
    <xref type="bio.tools">abricate</xref>
  </xrefs>
  <requirements>
    <requirement type="package" version="1.4.0">abricate</requirement>
  </requirements>
  <command detect_errors="exit_code">
        abricate list &gt; '$output'
    </command>
  <inputs>
    </inputs>
  <outputs>
    <data name="output" format="tabular" label="${tool.name} on ${on_string}: ABRicate List" />
  </outputs>
  <tests>
    <test>
      <output name="output" file="abricate_list.tabular" />
    </test>
  </tests>
  <help>
**What it does**

ABRicate List will list all the antibiotic databases used by ABRicate. The database of these genes is built from ResFinder.
    </help>
